add('b210','以阿斯旺長期蓄水調節串連土石壩與尼羅河水量~Connecting Aswan long-term storage with embankment behavior and Nile water accounting','公開工程事實與假想算例分開；下列尺寸水量及材料參數均不是阿斯旺設計或操作資料。~Public project facts are separate from hypothetical calculations; dimensions flows and material parameters below are not Aswan design or operating data.','敏感度：同面積500km2下年蒸發深度由1.8增至2.1m，水量損失由0.90增至1.05km3，增加0.15km3；實際湖面積會隨水位變化，故需逐時或逐月積分。~Sensitivity: over a fixed500km2 surface, annual evaporation increasing from1.8 to2.1m changes loss from0.90 to1.05km3, an increase of0.15km3. Real surface area varies with stage and requires time integration.',r'''
跨季庫容水量帳~Seasonal reservoir water balance§阿斯旺案例凸顯長期蓄水必須追蹤入流、放流與損失，單一洪峰並不能描述跨季可靠度。用共同時間窗更新庫存可檢查調節邏輯，但不能忽略水位面積與可用庫容限制；每個水量來源應保留獨立觀測與不確定度。~Aswan provides context for long-term storage accounting beyond a single flood peak. Update storage from inflow, release and losses over a common window. This bookkeeping does not remove stage-area or usable-storage limits, and each component needs independent observations and uncertainty rather than one balancing adjustment.§InitialStorage=8 km3; seasonalInflow=5 km3; releases=4 km3; netLoss=0.6 km3; finalStorage=8+5-4-0.6=8.4 km3§以庫水位容量曲線交叉核對同期流量積分的庫存變化~Cross-check integrated flows against storage change from the stage-capacity curve§把所有水量殘差當蒸發會掩蓋量測或漏列放流~Assigning every residual to evaporation conceals measurement errors or omitted releases§只知道洪峰流量就能判定跨季供水可靠度~Peak flood discharge alone determines seasonal supply reliability§8+5-4-0.6§8.4
大湖蒸發與面積~Lake evaporation and surface area§乾燥地區的大湖蒸發涉及水面面積與能量交換，蒸發深度不能直接當成水庫降深。湖面積隨水位變動，風場與氣象站代表性也會影響估算；固定面積算例只能說明單位換算，長期水量帳需用一致時間解析度積分。~Large-lake evaporation in an arid setting depends on surface area and energy exchange. Evaporation depth is not automatically reservoir stage decline. Area changes with level and station representativeness matters; a fixed-area calculation illustrates conversion while long-term budgets need consistent temporal integration.§HypotheticalArea=500 km2; evaporationDepth=1.8 m/year; lossVolume=500e6*1.8/1e9=0.90 km3/year§比較湖面氣象與蒸發估法並依逐月水位更新面積~Compare lake meteorology and evaporation methods and update area from monthly stage§直接以單一岸站蒸發量代表全湖可能形成系統偏差~Using one shore station for the entire lake can create systematic bias§蒸發一公尺就表示水庫水位必定下降一公尺~One metre of evaporation necessarily lowers reservoir level by one metre§500e6*1.8/1e9§0.9
防滲核心串聯阻力~Core seepage resistance in series§大型土石壩的不同土區可形成串聯與並聯流路，不能將各層滲透係數直接算術平均。等面積一維串聯模型以厚度除導水率形成阻力，可顯示低滲層控制作用；裂縫或接觸繞流則可能讓此理想串聯失效。~Different embankment zones create series and parallel paths, so arithmetic averaging of conductivity is generally inappropriate. Equal-area one-dimensional series resistance illustrates control by a low-permeability layer. Cracks and contact bypasses may defeat that idealization and must be checked independently of laboratory conductivity.§Equal areaA=100 m2; deltaHead=40 m; layers L1=10 m,k1=1e-7 m/s; L2=20 m,k2=1e-5 m/s; Q=100*40/(10/1e-7+20/1e-5)=0.0000392157 m3/s§以分層孔壓分配核對主要水頭損失是否位於低滲區~Use layered piezometric heads to locate the dominant head loss§沿接觸面繞流可避開原本控制流量的低滲核心~Contact bypass can avoid the low-permeability core that controls the ideal model§串聯各層滲透係數可以直接算術平均~Conductivities of layers in series can be averaged arithmetically§100*40/(10/1e-7+20/1e-5)§3.9215686274509805e-05
填築含水與乾密度~Placement moisture and dry density§土石壩填築品質需把含水量與乾密度連結，濕密度較高不一定代表骨架更密實，可能只是水較多。質量含水率的乾密度換算只核對試樣狀態，仍須依材料與試驗方法判定施工適用；層厚與壓實設備需共同驗證。~Placement quality requires both moisture and dry density. Higher wet density may reflect more water rather than a denser skeleton. Conversion using mass water content checks sample state only; material-specific testing, lift thickness and compaction equipment still determine whether placement is suitable.§wetDensity=2100 kg/m3; waterMassContent=0.12; dryDensity=2100/(1+0.12)=1875 kg/m3§將現地密度與同期含水樣品配對並核對分層位置~Pair field density with simultaneous moisture samples and identify the placement lift§濕土含水增加可能掩蓋乾密度不足~Increasing water content can conceal inadequate dry density§濕密度較高就必定代表壓實骨架更密~Higher wet density always proves a denser compacted skeleton§2100/1.12§1875
核心沉陷與接觸~Core settlement and interfaces§核心與壩殼的壓縮性差異會造成相對變形，剛性穿越構造附近尤其需要檢查接觸與反濾連續。相鄰沉陷差只能描述幾何需求，不能直接預測裂縫寬度；施工時序、材料非線性與三維約束會改變實際應變分布。~Different compressibility in core and shell creates relative movement, especially near rigid penetrations. Settlement difference describes geometric demand but does not directly predict crack aperture. Construction sequence, nonlinear material response and three-dimensional restraint govern the actual strain distribution and filter continuity.§coreSettlement=0.32 m; shellSettlement=0.20 m; relativeSettlement=0.32-0.20=0.12 m§比較跨土區沉陷測點與剛性構造接觸觀測~Compare settlement markers across zones with observations at rigid interfaces§差異沉陷集中於接觸面可能形成優先滲流路徑~Concentrated differential settlement at an interface can create preferential seepage§相鄰沉陷差就必定等於核心裂縫寬度~Settlement difference necessarily equals the width of a core crack§0.32-0.20§0.12
發電淨水頭與出力~Net head and power output§大型蓄水壩的發電能力由流量、淨水頭與效率共同控制，庫水位只是上游水頭的一部分。尾水上升與水路損失會降低淨落差，裝置容量也不等於任何時刻能達到的出力；應以一致工況的量測核對能量轉換。~Power depends on flow, net head and efficiency. Reservoir level is only one upstream contribution; tailwater and conveyance losses reduce usable head. Installed capacity is not guaranteed output at every stage, so compare energy conversion using measurements from the same operating condition.§rho=1000 kg/m3; Q=180 m3/s; netHead=55 m; efficiency=0.90; power=1000*9.81*180*55*0.90/1e6=87.4071 MW§同步記錄上下游水位流量與機組功率並列水路損失~Record upstream and downstream levels, flow and unit power and itemize waterway losses§只用壩高當發電水頭會高估可用能量~Using dam height as generating head overstates usable energy§壩體高度就是所有水位下的機組淨水頭~Dam height equals turbine net head at every reservoir level§1000*9.81*180*55*0.9/1e6§87.4071
淤積量與乾密度~Sediment storage and dry density§水庫截留泥砂會改變容量與入流三角洲，乾砂質量轉體積需考慮壓密和粒徑分區。相同質量在不同乾密度下佔據不同庫容，不能把水樣固體體積直接當沉積總體積；需要重複測深與分層取樣建立長期變化。~Trapped sediment changes storage and delta geometry. Converting dry mass to deposit volume requires compaction and grain-size zoning. Equal mass occupies different bulk volume at different dry densities; repeat bathymetry and layered samples rather than treating grain volume as total deposited volume.§AnnualTrappedDryMass=1.2e6 t; depositDryDensity=1.3 t/m3; depositedBulkVolume=1.2e6/1.3=923077 m3§以測深差與分層乾密度交叉核算沉積質量~Cross-check bathymetric change and layered dry density against sediment mass§忽略壓密會把容量變化誤讀成同量泥砂增減~Ignoring consolidation confuses storage change with an equal change in sediment mass§乾砂顆粒體積就是整層沉積物的總體積~Dry grain volume equals the total bulk deposit volume§1.2e6/1.3§923076.9230769231
放流輸配與需水~Release conveyance and demand§水庫放流經輸配系統到達用水端，取水量與有效供水之間有蒸散、滲漏與回歸水等差異。簡化效率只定義特定邊界的比值，不能把所有損失都視為流域消耗；應先界定取用點與回歸路徑，再計算放流需求。~Released water passes through a conveyance system before reaching demand. A simplified efficiency belongs to a defined boundary and does not classify every loss as basin consumption; seepage or drainage may return elsewhere. Define delivery points and return paths before converting a service demand into release volume.§TargetDeliveredVolume=60 million m3; definedConveyanceEfficiency=0.75; requiredRelease=60/0.75=80 million m3§核對水庫出口用水端與回歸水的同時水量帳~Reconcile simultaneous volumes at release, delivery and return-flow boundaries§把回歸水全當消耗會高估流域淨需水~Treating all return water as consumption overstates basin net demand§所有輸配損失都等於流域永久耗水~Every conveyance loss equals permanent basin water consumption§60/0.75§80
枯水連續與備援~Drought sequence and reserve§長期蓄水需要面對連續低入流，而非只看平均年供需。以累積短缺估算備援容量可展示序列效應，但假設需求、損失和初始庫容均已界定；實際可靠度還需多種水文序列、操作限制與不確定度分析。~Carryover storage responds to sequences of low inflow, not just average annual balance. Cumulative deficits illustrate reserve demand for defined demand, losses and initial storage. Reliability still requires multiple hydrological sequences, operating constraints and uncertainty rather than treating one synthetic drought as universal.§Three annual deficits=0.4,0.7,0.3 km3; no intervening refill; cumulativeReserveDemand=0.4+0.7+0.3=1.4 km3§比較不同乾旱排列下的最低庫容並保留需求假設~Compare minimum storage under different drought sequences and retain demand assumptions§只用平均入流會忽略連年不足的累積效應~Mean inflow alone hides cumulative deficits over consecutive dry years§平均年入流足夠就保證任何乾旱序列都供水無缺~Adequate mean inflow guarantees supply through every drought sequence§0.4+0.7+0.3§1.4
監測基線與異常~Monitoring baseline and anomaly§大型壩監測應將庫水位與季節溫度造成的可逆反應和持續變化分開。基線殘差能提示不同於歷史關係的訊號，但資料漂移與工況外插也可能造成異常；應用獨立儀器與現場檢查確認，不以重新擬合消除警訊。~Monitoring separates reversible stage and seasonal effects from persistent change. A baseline residual flags departures from historical relations, but sensor drift and extrapolation also create anomalies. Confirm using independent measurements and inspection rather than erasing a new signal by refitting the baseline to it.§MeasuredMovement=14 mm; baselinePrediction=9 mm for same state; residual=14-9=5 mm§比較鄰近獨立儀器與人工測量並核對基線適用水位範圍~Compare independent instruments and manual surveys and check the baseline stage range§超出歷史水位範圍的外插可能被誤當結構劣化~Extrapolation beyond historical stages can be mistaken for structural deterioration§基線殘差不為零就必定代表壩體正在失效~Any nonzero baseline residual proves the dam is failing§14-9§5
''')
add('b211','以塔貝拉深厚地基防滲及既有水路擴建界面學習~Studying Tarbela foundation seepage control and existing-waterway expansion interfaces','合成土石壩與水路模型不重現塔貝拉現況，實際地層、設備與調度須以業主資料另行建立。~Synthetic embankment and waterway models do not reconstruct Tarbela conditions; owner data must establish actual geology equipment and operations.','敏感度：同滲透係數與面積下，示意水路長度由400增至600m，達西流量減至三分之二；鋪蓋延長的真實效果需二維或三維流網，不能用此比例直接估算實際壩基改善。~Sensitivity: at fixed conductivity and area, increasing an illustrative seepage path from400 to600m reduces Darcy flow to two-thirds. Real blanket extension requires a two- or three-dimensional flow model rather than direct use of this ratio.',r'''
大體積填築物流~Bulk placement logistics§塔貝拉的土石壩型式提供大量填築物流的學習背景，車輛載量、循環時間與有效工時共同限制日產量。理想車隊算例假設供料與攤鋪不成瓶頸，實際還需檢查材料分區、道路干擾與品質驗收速度，不能只加車就宣稱產能增加。~Tarbela provides context for large embankment placement logistics. Truck payload, cycle time and productive hours limit output. An ideal fleet estimate assumes loading and spreading are unconstrained; material zoning, road interference and acceptance capacity can become bottlenecks, so adding vehicles alone does not guarantee more placement.§trucks=20; payload=18 m3; cyclesPerHour=2; productiveHours=8; looseVolume=20*18*2*8=5760 m3/day§核對過磅循環時間與攤鋪驗收紀錄並分別列鬆方實方~Reconcile haul cycles with placement acceptance and distinguish loose from compacted volume§把鬆方直接當完成實方會高估填築進度~Counting loose volume as completed compacted volume overstates progress§增加運輸車數就保證攤鋪完成量同比增加~More haul trucks guarantee a proportional increase in accepted placement§20*18*2*8§5760
鋪蓋延伸與流路~Blanket extension and seepage paths§上游防滲鋪蓋可改變進入地基的水頭分布與流路長度，不能只看壩體核心而忽略深部地基。均質一維達西式只是方向性示意，鋪蓋邊緣、分層及局部穿透會產生二維效應；需以孔壓分布和分區流量檢驗。~An upstream blanket changes foundation entry heads and seepage paths, making foundation control distinct from the core. A uniform one-dimensional Darcy calculation illustrates direction only. Blanket edges, layering and penetrations create two-dimensional effects that require piezometric and zoned-discharge validation.§k=0.0001 m/s; effectiveArea=2000 m2; headDifference=60 m; pathLength=400 m; Q=0.0001*2000*60/400=0.030 m3/s§用鋪蓋前後及壩基孔壓剖面檢查實際水頭分配~Compare heads across the blanket and foundation to establish the actual distribution§鋪蓋局部缺口可能形成短流路而削弱整體效果~A local blanket opening can create a short path that undermines overall performance§鋪蓋越長就可不必檢查局部破損與邊緣效應~A longer blanket removes the need to inspect defects and edge effects§0.0001*2000*60/400§0.03
分層導水與各向異性~Layered conductivity and anisotropy§沖積地基中水平連續砂礫層與低滲夾層可使水平及垂直導水率不同，單一等向係數可能誤判孔壓。平行層等厚加權只適用層內流向，跨層方向需用阻力式；應以鑽探和試驗建立層序與連通性。~Continuous granular layers and low-permeability seams create directional conductivity. One isotropic value can misrepresent pressures. Thickness-weighted averaging applies to flow parallel to layers, whereas cross-layer flow uses resistance weighting. Boreholes and testing must establish both layer sequence and hydraulic connectivity.§Parallel flow through equal-thickness layers: k1=1e-3 m/s;k2=1e-5 m/s; horizontalK=(1e-3+1e-5)/2=0.000505 m/s§比較不同方向的試驗與孔壓反應並繪製連續高滲層~Compare directional tests and pressure response and map connected high-permeability layers§把水平平均導水率用於垂直流會扭曲滲流分布~Using horizontal averaged conductivity for vertical flow distorts the seepage field§分層地基的水平與垂直導水率必定相同~Layered foundations must have equal horizontal and vertical conductivity§(1e-3+1e-5)/2§0.000505
出口梯度與有效重量~Exit gradient and submerged weight§向上滲流可能減少顆粒骨架有效重量，出口梯度需與土的水下重量和拘束比較。臨界梯度簡式用於均勻無黏性土的浮起尺度，不是所有內部沖蝕的起始門檻；局部集中流與反濾失效可能在其他條件下發生。~Upward seepage reduces effective skeleton weight. A critical-gradient expression describes heave of uniform cohesionless soil, not the threshold for every internal-erosion mechanism. Concentrated flow and failed retention can develop under other conditions, so check local gradients and filter function separately.§grainSpecificGravity=2.65; voidRatio=0.65; idealHeaveGradient=(2.65-1)/(1+0.65)=1.00 dimensionless§以出口附近密集孔壓量測核對局部梯度並觀察顆粒流失~Measure local exit gradients with closely spaced piezometers and observe particle loss§用平均全壩梯度代替局部出口梯度會漏掉集中作用~An average whole-dam gradient can conceal concentrated exit effects§低於理想浮起梯度就排除所有內部沖蝕~A gradient below ideal heave excludes every internal-erosion mechanism§(2.65-1)/(1+0.65)§1
蓄水分期與孔壓~Impoundment stages and pore pressure§分期蓄水使工程師能比較庫水位改變與地基孔壓及變形反應，觀察時間需符合材料和儀器的反應尺度。單一升水步的平均速率不代表可接受操作速度；應按核准程序及失效模式判讀，並辨識尚未達平衡的深層測點。~Staged impoundment enables comparison of stage changes with pressure and deformation responses. Observation periods must fit material and instrument response times. A mean rise rate is descriptive, not an authorized rate; interpret it through approved procedures and failure modes and identify deep points still out of equilibrium.§HypotheticalStageIncrease=4.5 m; observationInterval=9 days; meanRiseRate=4.5/9=0.50 m/day§對照分期水位與深淺孔壓的延遲及穩定趨勢~Compare staged levels with shallow and deep pressure lags and stabilization trends§只看淺層孔壓穩定會漏掉深層尚未消散的變化~Stable shallow pressures can hide continuing deep pressure changes§淺層孔壓穩定就表示整個地基都已達平衡~Stable shallow pressure means the entire foundation is at equilibrium§4.5/9§0.5
三角洲推進與測深~Delta advance and bathymetry§水庫泥砂三角洲推進會改變有效庫容與進水口周邊地形，前緣位移不等於沉積體積。用平均剖面積乘推進距離僅作稜柱近似，沿寬變化和壓密需另處理；應把斷面追蹤、粒徑與輸砂帳連結。~Delta advance changes storage and intake surroundings, but front movement alone is not deposit volume. Mean cross-sectional area times advance is a prism approximation that omits lateral changes and consolidation. Link repeated sections, grain-size observations and sediment budgets before interpreting long-term progression.§MeanDepositionalCrossSection=2500 m2; frontAdvance=120 m; prismDepositVolume=2500*120=300000 m3§沿多條測線追蹤前緣及斷面變化並核對沉積乾密度~Track front and section changes along several transects and check deposit dry density§用單一中心線推進代表全庫寬會誤估沉積體積~Using one centerline advance for the full width misestimates deposit volume§三角洲前緣前進距離本身就是淤積體積~Delta-front advance distance itself equals deposited volume§2500*120§300000
進水口餘隙與淤積~Intake clearance and deposition§既有進水口的底部餘隙會隨沉積與庫水位變化，幾何淨距不足可能提高吸砂與堵塞風險。標高差只提供空間盤點，不預測局部三維取水或再懸浮；需同時觀測底床地形、流速與取水濃度。~Intake clearance changes with deposition and stage, potentially increasing sediment ingestion or blockage. An elevation difference describes geometry, not three-dimensional withdrawal or resuspension. Combine bed surveys, approach velocities and intake concentration to interpret whether the remaining space is hydraulically adequate.§IntakeLowerLipElevation=300 m; localSedimentElevation=292 m; verticalClearance=300-292=8 m§重測進水口前底床並比較取水含砂與局部流速~Resurvey the intake bed and compare sediment ingestion with local velocity§只量遠處平均庫底會漏掉進水口前局部淤丘~A distant mean bed level misses a local mound in front of the intake§平均庫底夠低就保證進水口前沒有淤堵~A low mean reservoir bed guarantees no intake-local blockage§300-292§8
既有隧道擴建損失~Existing tunnel conversion losses§把既有放水隧道接入新增機組時，流量與壓力邊界改變會影響摩阻和暫態，不能只查隧道直徑是否足夠。局部損失係數乘速度水頭可盤點轉接件作用，還需核對接頭、分岔與下游調節對整體系統的影響。~Connecting new generation to an existing release tunnel changes flow and pressure boundaries, affecting friction and transients. Diameter alone is insufficient. A local-loss calculation accounts for one transition, while joints, branching and downstream regulation require a system assessment under the converted operating conditions.§AssumedTransitionK=0.35; meanV=9 m/s; localHeadLoss=0.35*9**2/(2*9.81)=1.44495 m§比較改接前後能量線與接頭壓力並核對實際構形~Compare energy lines and joint pressures before and after connection and verify geometry§新增轉接損失會降低機組可用淨水頭~Added connection losses reduce net head available to the generating unit§原有隧道直徑足夠就不必檢查改接水頭損失~Adequate existing diameter removes the need to check conversion head losses§0.35*81/(2*9.81)§1.4449541284403669
發電用水與放流協調~Generation flow and release coordination§新增發電功能可能利用原有放流水量，但發電時段與灌溉或下游需求的時間尺度不同。能量算例需清楚定義有效出力與時數，不能把裝置容量全年相乘當保證發電；水量與尾水限制需在共同調度邊界核對。~New generation may use existing releases, but its timing can differ from irrigation or downstream needs. Energy requires defined output and duration; nameplate power times a full year is not guaranteed generation. Reconcile water and tailwater constraints within a common scheduling boundary.§HypotheticalDeliveredPower=450 MW; actualGeneratingDuration=6 h; energy=450*6=2700 MWh§以機組電量表與同期放流水量核對發電時窗~Compare metered energy with release volumes over the same generating window§把停機或缺水時段也當滿載會高估年度電量~Counting outages or water-limited periods as full output overstates annual energy§裝置容量乘全年時數就是保證可售電量~Nameplate capacity times annual hours equals guaranteed saleable energy§450*6§2700
出口消能與修復證據~Outlet dissipation and repair evidence§大型低位出口將高水頭轉為高速射流，下游消能與岩床反應必須和洞內壓力一起評估。水力功率給能量速率，不能直接預測沖坑深度；修復前後需以相同流量尾水比較壓力、地形及材料損傷，避免混淆工況改善與構造改善。~Large low outlets convert head into jets, requiring linked assessment of tunnel pressure, dissipation and the receiving bed. Hydraulic power is an energy rate rather than a scour-depth law. Compare repairs at matching discharge and tailwater using pressures, surveys and damage records to separate operating changes from structural improvement.§Q=150 m3/s; dissipatedHead=70 m; rho=1000 kg/m3; hydraulicPower=1000*9.81*150*70/1e6=103.005 MW§對齊修復前後流量尾水並比較水墊壓力及沖坑測深~Match discharge and tailwater before and after repair and compare pool pressure and scour surveys§較小洪水後損傷減少不一定證明修復構造更有效~Less damage after a smaller flood does not by itself prove a better repair§修復後損傷較少就不必比較前後水力工況~Less postrepair damage removes the need to compare hydraulic conditions§1000*9.81*150*70/1e6§103.005
''')
add('b212','由卡里巴修復工程連結拱壩水墊沖蝕與閘門界面~Connecting Kariba rehabilitation with arch action plunge-pool scour and gate interfaces','本課模型只是修復議題的機制示意，未重建卡里巴設計；舊工程頁的預定完工年不當實際完工事實。~Models illustrate rehabilitation mechanisms without reconstructing Kariba design; old scheduled completion dates are not treated as achieved milestones.','敏感度：相同射流合力900kN分布於30或45m2時，平均壓力由30降至20kPa；擴大作用面積可降低平均值，但岩節理瞬時壓力及局部峰值仍須獨立驗證。~Sensitivity: spreading the same900kN resultant over30 rather than45m2 changes mean pressure from30 to20kPa. A larger area lowers the mean, while joint-pressure pulses and local peaks still require independent verification.',r'''
拱作用與壩肩傳力~Arch action and abutment transfer§卡里巴的拱壩背景要求理解水壓如何經曲率傳向壩肩，水平薄環近似只處理一部分受力。實際壩同時具有懸臂、接縫與地基相互作用，不能把一條薄拱環代表全壩；壩肩剛度與節理會改變拱向力分配。~Kariba provides context for pressure transfer through curvature toward abutments. A thin horizontal ring represents only one component of response. Real behavior includes cantilever action, joints and foundation interaction; one ring cannot stand for the whole dam, and abutment stiffness changes the load distribution.§Ideal thin ring: pressure=0.6 MPa; radius=100 m; thickness=15 m; hoopCompression=0.6*100/15=4 MPa§以壩體位移及壩肩地質模型核對拱向傳力假設~Compare dam displacement and abutment geology with assumed arch load transfer§壩肩柔化可能使原本假設的拱向分配失效~Abutment softening can invalidate the assumed arch-force distribution§一條薄環公式就能代表整座拱壩全部應力~One thin-ring equation represents every stress in an arch dam§0.6*100/15§4
水位荷載與非線性~Reservoir load and nonlinear response§水位變化同時改變受壓高度與壓力大小，合力因此不與水深線性成長。用矩形投影估水平靜水力可說明尺度，拱壩實際位移還受溫度及接縫開合影響；監測比較必須分離水位與季節效應。~Stage changes both loaded height and pressure, so resultant force does not grow linearly with depth. A projected rectangular surface illustrates horizontal loading, while actual arch displacement also depends on temperature and joint opening. Monitoring comparisons must separate stage and seasonal effects.§Unit projected width=1 m; waterDepth=80 m; horizontalForce=0.5*9.81*80**2=31392 kN per m width§以不同季節相同水位的位移資料比較可逆反應~Compare displacement at the same stage in different seasons to identify reversible response§把溫度變形全歸因水位會錯估荷載敏感度~Attributing all thermal movement to stage misstates load sensitivity§水深增加一成靜水合力也必定只增加一成~A ten-percent depth increase always raises hydrostatic force only ten percent§0.5*9.81*80**2§31392
水舌入池能量~Jet energy entering the pool§溢流水舌攜帶動能進入水墊，能量率可用流量與落差估尺度，但實際分布受閘門組合與水舌含氣影響。總功率不能決定單一岩塊荷載，需把全系統能量和局部壓力分開量測，才能評估修復目標。~Spill jets carry energy into the plunge pool, with discharge and head defining a system-level rate. Gate combinations and aeration alter its distribution. Total power does not determine force on one rock block; separate global energy accounting from local pressure measurements when evaluating rehabilitation objectives.§Q=200 m3/s; netDrop=60 m; power=1000*9.81*200*60/1e6=117.72 MW§同步記錄各孔流量水位與水舌落點並比較池底壓力~Record gate flows, levels and jet footprints together with bed pressures§總流量相同但閘門組合不同可能移動集中沖擊區~Equal total flow with different gate combinations can shift concentrated impact§總流量相同就保證水墊內全部壓力相同~Equal total discharge guarantees identical pressures throughout the pool§1000*9.81*200*60/1e6§117.72
水墊展寬與平均壓力~Pool spreading and mean pressure§水墊整形希望改善射流擴散與下游出流，不能把增加體積直接解讀為所有壓力都按比例下降。平均合力除面積只是整體量級，局部脈壓與回流仍可能集中；需用多點同步壓力與流場驗證整形後的分布。~Pool reshaping aims to improve spreading and downstream conveyance. More volume does not make every pressure fall proportionally. Force divided by area describes an average, while pulses and recirculation may remain concentrated; validate distributions with synchronized pressure arrays and flow observations.§PrescribedResultant=900 kN; effectiveArea=45 m2; meanPressure=900/45=20 kPa§比較整形前後同工況下的壓力分布及回流範圍~Compare pressure distributions and recirculation before and after reshaping at matched conditions§只報平均壓力下降會掩蓋新形成的局部高壓點~A reduced mean can conceal a newly concentrated high-pressure location§水墊體積增加就保證所有局部脈壓同比下降~A larger pool guarantees a proportional reduction in every local pressure pulse§900/45§20
節理壓差與拔出~Joint pressure and block removal§岩床沖蝕常受節理塊體控制，脈壓可沿連通裂隙傳到塊底，與頂面壓力形成淨揚力。給定壓差乘面積僅計水力一項，抗力仍含水下重量、咬合與剪阻；完整岩石強度不能代替節理調查。~Scour in jointed rock often involves blocks. Pressure pulses transmitted through connected cracks create uplift relative to the block top. Differential pressure times area gives one hydraulic component; submerged weight, interlock and shear provide separate resistance. Intact rock strength cannot replace joint mapping.§underBlockPressure=90 kPa; topPressure=60 kPa; blockArea=2 m2; netUplift=(90-60)*2=60 kN§同步量測節理內外壓力並核對岩塊形狀及連通裂隙~Measure pressures inside and outside joints and map block geometry and connectivity§連通節理可使低平均水面壓力下仍發生局部拔出~Connected joints can enable local plucking despite low mean surface pressure§完整岩石強度高就不需檢查節理壓差~High intact strength removes the need to check pressure across joints§(90-60)*2§60
回向沖蝕與距離~Backward scour and separation distance§沖坑朝壩基方向擴展的後果與相對位置有關，不能只追蹤最大深度。平面最短距離可做監測指標，但安全判定還需三維岩體、可能滑移面與水力作用；量測基準和沖坑邊界定義應保持一致。~Scour moving toward the foundation matters through location as well as maximum depth. Plan separation is a monitoring indicator, not a safety verdict. Three-dimensional rock geometry, potential sliding surfaces and hydraulics still govern consequences; maintain consistent survey datums and edge definitions over time.§FoundationReferenceX=0 m; scourEdgeOld=75 m; scourEdgeNew=68 m; approachDistance=75-68=7 m§以同基準三維地形比較沖坑邊緣深度與壩基相對位置~Compare scour edges and depths relative to the foundation using consistent three-dimensional surveys§只測最深點會漏掉較淺但朝壩基推進的侵蝕~Tracking only the deepest point misses shallower erosion advancing toward the foundation§最大沖深不變就表示沖坑完全沒有不利變化~Unchanged maximum depth proves that no adverse scour change has occurred§75-68§7
圍堰抽排與水量~Cofferdam dewatering balance§既有水工修復的圍堰抽排需要隔離施工區並維持核准水位，抽水能力要與滲入及降雨來源配對。定入流蓄水式只估短時水位變化，不能取代地基隆起、圍堰穩定及停電工況；應同步監測內外水頭與抽排量。~Rehabilitation cofferdams isolate a work area under approved level conditions. Pumping must be matched to seepage and rainfall inputs. A short-interval balance estimates level change only; it does not address heave, cofferdam stability or power failure, which require concurrent head and flow monitoring.§inflow=0.12 m3/s; pumping=0.20 m3/s; basinArea=800 m2; duration=600 s; drawdown=(0.20-0.12)*600/800=0.060 m§記錄抽排量內外水位與地基孔壓並核對停泵反應~Record pumping, inside and outside levels and foundation pressures and examine pump-stop response§抽排加快可能增大內外水頭差而改變地基風險~Faster dewatering can enlarge differential head and alter foundation risk§抽水能力越大就保證圍堰施工越安全~Greater pumping capacity always makes cofferdam work safer§(0.2-0.12)*600/800§0.06
閘槽變形與淨距~Sluice deformation and clearance§長期混凝土變形可能影響閘槽淨距與啟閉，需區分材料膨脹、溫度與結構位移。幾何扣減能示範餘隙消耗，但實際閘門摩擦和扭斜還受支承及止水影響；應沿全行程查核而非只量單一開度。~Long-term concrete deformation can affect gate clearance and travel. Distinguish material expansion from thermal and structural movement. A clearance deduction shows geometric consumption, while friction and skew also depend on supports and seals; inspect the entire travel path rather than one opening.§InitialTotalClearance=18 mm; leftIntrusion=4 mm; rightIntrusion=5 mm; remainingClearance=18-4-5=9 mm§沿槽全高量測淨距並與啟閉負荷及溫度時序比較~Survey clearance throughout the slot and compare operating loads and temperature histories§單一位置淨距正常仍可能在其他行程卡阻~Normal clearance at one position can coexist with binding elsewhere§某一開度運轉正常就證明整個行程都不會卡阻~Normal operation at one opening proves the gate cannot bind anywhere§18-4-5§9
備援隔水與載重~Backup isolation and loading§備援閘門或隔水構件的用途是建立可維護邊界，其受力取決於隔離後兩側水位，不能把平常低壓差當最不利情境。平均壓差乘面積只算給定分布的合力，導軌、密封與起吊狀態還需依完整工況驗證。~Backup isolation establishes a maintainable boundary. Its load depends on both water levels after isolation, not the low differential during normal operation. Mean pressure times area gives one prescribed resultant; guides, seals and lifting states still need verification across the complete load cases.§SpecifiedMeanDifferentialPressure=250 kPa; effectiveArea=20 m2; isolationForce=250*20=5000 kN§將隔離前後水位組合列入荷載表並檢查導軌反力~List pre- and post-isolation water levels and check guide reactions§維修側排乾後壓差增加可能超出平常操作荷載~Dewatering the maintenance side increases differential load beyond normal operation§平常低壓差就代表隔水構件永遠只受小荷載~Normally low differential pressure means isolation components always carry small loads§250*20§5000
修復效益與同工況~Rehabilitation benefit and matched states§修復驗證應使用相近水位、流量與閘門組合比較，否則較溫和的工況會被誤認成構造改善。無因次指標可降低部分尺度影響，但不消除地形與材料改變；應把壓力、沖蝕和操作可靠度分別建立證據鏈。~Evaluate rehabilitation at comparable levels, discharge and gate combinations. Milder operation can otherwise masquerade as structural improvement. Dimensionless measures reduce some scaling effects but do not remove geometry or material changes; maintain separate evidence for pressure, scour and operating reliability.§Matched conditions: oldPressureRMS=30 kPa; newPressureRMS=24 kPa; relativeReduction=(30-24)/30*100=20 percent§用匹配工況資料比較壓力頻譜與空間分布而非只比較均值~Compare spectra and spatial pressure distributions at matched conditions, not only means§未匹配流量就計改善百分比可能製造虛假成效~An improvement percentage without matched discharge can be misleading§任意兩次量測相減就能證明修復成效~Subtracting any two measurements proves rehabilitation performance§(30-24)/30*100§20
''')
add('b213','以阿科松博土石壩廣域湖泊與發電放流界面學習~Studying Akosombo embankment lake storage and generation-release interfaces','業主確認壩型與建設年代；公開頁高度長度互有矛盾故不採用，下列工程數值全為教學假設。~The owner confirms dam type and construction dates; conflicting published heights and lengths are excluded and all lesson engineering values are hypothetical.','敏感度：固定淨水頭60m與效率0.9，流量由200增至250m3/s，出力由105.948增至132.435MW；若尾水隨放流上升，實際增加會小於此固定水頭推估。~Sensitivity: at fixed60m net head and0.9 efficiency, increasing discharge from200 to250m3/s raises output from105.948 to132.435MW. Rising tailwater would reduce the gain relative to this fixed-head estimate.',r'''
堆石濕陷與水位~Rockfill wetting and settlement§堆石壩蓄水可能改變顆粒接觸與破碎，濕潤後變形需與施工壓實沉陷分開。平均軸向應變乘厚度只估均勻壓縮量，不能代表整壩三維沉陷；應以分區材料試驗與蓄水前後測點反應建立對照，避免只看壩頂總量。~Wetting can change rockfill contacts and breakage, and its deformation should be separated from construction settlement. Mean axial strain times thickness describes uniform compression only, not the three-dimensional dam. Compare zoned material tests with pre- and postimpoundment markers rather than relying on crest settlement alone.§SyntheticLayerThickness=40 m; prescribedWettingStrain=0.004; uniformSettlement=40*0.004=0.16 m§比對分層沉陷與濕潤前緣孔壓時序並核對材料破碎~Compare layered settlement with wetting-front pressure histories and material breakage§濕陷集中於局部區帶可能增加核心與壩殼相對變形~Localized wetting settlement can increase differential movement between core and shell§所有蓄水後沉陷都只是施工壓實尚未完成~Every postimpoundment settlement merely reflects unfinished construction compaction§40*0.004§0.16
合成核心應力轉移~Synthetic core stress transfer§合成土石壩核心與兩側材料剛度不同時，拱效應可能把部分豎向荷載轉移到較硬區，降低核心局部總應力。單一有效應力差只呈現孔壓餘量，不能直接預報水力劈裂；需評估最小主應力、材料拉伸特性與接觸變形。~In a synthetic zoned dam, stiffness contrast can transfer vertical load away from the core. A scalar effective-stress difference illustrates pressure margin but does not predict hydraulic fracture. Evaluate minimum principal stress, tensile behavior and interface deformation instead of treating average overburden as the complete stress state.§PrescribedNormalTotalStress=500 kPa; porePressure=350 kPa; effectiveNormalStress=500-350=150 kPa§比較核心內應力與孔壓並檢查相鄰材料變形差~Compare core stress and pore pressure with deformation differences in adjacent zones§用平均覆土重量代替局部最小應力可能漏掉劈裂敏感區~Average overburden can conceal regions with low local minimum stress§平均覆土應力高就保證核心各方向應力都高~High average overburden guarantees high stress in every core direction§500-350§150
反濾過渡與細粒~Filter transitions and fines§堆石與細粒防滲材料之間需要連續過渡，否則粒徑反差可能讓細土移入大孔隙。示意粒徑比只供辨認幾何尺度，不是所有土類的核准準則；材料分離、施工污染及交界厚度都須以分區取樣與試驗確認。~Transitions between rockfill and fine barrier material must remain continuous to prevent fines entering large pores. An illustrative grain-size ratio identifies scale but does not approve every soil type. Verify segregation, contamination and interface thickness through zoned sampling and applicable material tests.§SyntheticTransitionD15=0.8 mm; protectedSoild85=0.25 mm; ratio=0.8/0.25=3.2 dimensionless§於實際鋪築位置取樣核對界面兩側級配與連續厚度~Sample placed material to check both interface gradations and continuous thickness§只驗料場級配會漏掉運輸鋪築造成的分離~Testing only the stockpile misses segregation during transport and placement§料場試驗合格就保證每個鋪築界面都合格~Passing stockpile tests guarantees every placed interface is acceptable§0.8/0.25§3.2
分孔洩流與不均流~Multiple bays and uneven discharge§多孔溢洪道的總流量由各孔實際開度與水頭決定，孔數平均不代表局部水舌或下游壓力相同。合成各孔流量加總只是水量帳；閘門組合改變可能使相鄰水舌交互作用，須對照下游消能與岸坡反應。~Total spillway flow sums actual bay discharges, not an assumed uniform share. Adding synthetic bay flows is only mass accounting. Different combinations can alter jet interaction and downstream pressure, so check dissipation and bank response alongside opening and head at each bay.§Three hypothetical bays discharge=120,100,80 m3/s; totalQ=120+100+80=300 m3/s§同步記錄各孔開度與下游水舌位置並核對總流量~Record bay openings and downstream jet positions together and check total flow§相同總洩量的不同孔組合可能集中衝擊單側岸坡~Different bay combinations at equal total flow can concentrate impact on one bank§總洩量相同就表示所有閘門組合效果相同~Equal total release means every gate combination has the same effect§120+100+80§300
共用設備與可用率~Shared equipment and availability§共用啟閉設備使多個閘門在維修與故障時具有共同依賴，不能把各孔當完全獨立備援。串聯可用率乘積僅適用獨立失效及簡化狀態，現場共因故障需另建事件樹；應檢查設備移動時間、停機及替代方案。~Shared hoisting equipment creates common dependencies among gates. Multiplying availabilities represents an ideal independent series system only; common-cause failures require another model. Examine movement time, outages and alternatives instead of counting every gate as fully independent redundancy merely because the leaves are separate.§Ideal independent gate-and-hoist availability: gate=0.98; hoist=0.95; combined=0.98*0.95=0.931 dimensionless§以故障維修紀錄分辨共用與獨立設備並核對替代啟閉能力~Use maintenance records to distinguish shared and independent equipment and check alternative actuation§共用啟閉機停機可同時限制多個原本完好的閘門~A shared hoist outage can constrain several otherwise functional gates§閘門數量多就保證沒有任何共同失效點~A large number of gates guarantees no common failure point§0.98*0.95§0.931
機組出力與水頭~Generating output and hydraulic head§阿科松博提供水庫發電與放流協調的案例，機組出力需用淨水頭而不是壩高。尾水與進水損失會隨流量改變，效率也受工作點影響；合成定效率算例只是能量量級，不能以裝置容量倒推出未量測的流量。~Akosombo provides context for coordinated reservoir generation and releases. Output uses net head rather than dam height; tailwater, losses and efficiency vary with operating point. A constant-efficiency illustration gives an energy scale and does not justify recovering unmeasured flow directly from nameplate capacity.§rho=1000 kg/m3; Q=200 m3/s; netHead=60 m; efficiency=0.90; power=1000*9.81*200*60*0.90/1e6=105.948 MW§以同期電功率流量及上下游水位核對效率範圍~Check efficiency using simultaneous electrical power, flow and both water levels§用固定最高效率套全年工況會高估發電量~Applying peak efficiency to every operating state overstates generation§裝置容量就是任何水頭下都能維持的出力~Nameplate capacity is output that can be maintained at every head§1000*9.81*200*60*0.9/1e6§105.948
廣域湖面與庫容~Broad lake surface and storage§大面積湖泊的小幅水位變化可能對應大量庫容，但面積並非固定，岸線地形使水位容量關係非線性。以定面積近似只適用短範圍示意，應使用實測地形更新曲線；不同高程基準不能直接拼接成容量變化。~A small level change over a broad lake can represent substantial storage, but shoreline geometry makes area variable. A constant-area approximation covers a limited range only. Update the relation from bathymetry and keep vertical datums consistent rather than joining unlike surveys into a storage trend.§HypotheticalMeanArea=1000 km2; stageChange=0.20 m; localStorageChange=1000e6*0.20/1e6=200 million m3§以分水位面積曲線與重複測深核對局部容量斜率~Check local storage slope using stage-area curves and repeat bathymetry§固定面積外推大幅洩降會錯估可用庫容~Constant-area extrapolation over large drawdown misstates usable storage§湖面積一旦量過就能固定用於所有水位~One measured lake area applies unchanged at every stage§1000e6*0.2/1e6§200
風浪水位與壩頂~Wind setup and crest checks§廣域湖泊的風作用可能造成平均水位壅高與短時波浪，兩者應分開並與壩頂高程比較。簡化淨餘高只是已指定工況的幾何帳，不能替代波浪爬升或可靠度分析；還需考慮沉陷、浪向與岸形聚焦。~Wind over a broad lake can produce both setup and waves, which must be distinguished in crest checks. A geometric clearance calculation applies to a prescribed case and does not replace runup or reliability analysis. Settlement, direction and shoreline focusing also affect local conditions.§crestElevation=102 m; stillWater=99 m; setup=0.3 m; prescribedRunup=1.2 m; clearance=102-99-0.3-1.2=1.5 m§比較壩前水位波浪紀錄與壩頂沉陷並標明浪向~Compare near-dam water levels and waves with crest settlement and wave direction§忽略壩頂長期沉陷會高估剩餘餘高~Ignoring long-term crest settlement overstates remaining freeboard§靜水位低於壩頂就保證不會有波浪越頂~Still water below the crest guarantees no wave overtopping§102-99-0.3-1.2§1.5
下游流量爬升~Downstream discharge ramping§發電調峰會改變下游放流時序，平均日水量相同仍可能造成不同水位變化速度。流量差除時間只是放流變率，不能直接等同下游任一斷面的水位升速；河道儲水、傳播時間與支流入流需用路由與量測評估。~Peaking changes release timing even when daily volume is unchanged. Discharge change divided by time is a release ramp, not the water-level rise at every downstream section. Channel storage, travel time and tributaries require routing and observations to determine actual downstream response.§ReleaseChangesFrom=100 to220 m3/s over30 min; meanDischargeRamp=(220-100)/30=4 m3/s per min§同步記錄電廠放流與下游多站水位以辨認傳播延遲~Record plant release and downstream levels at several stations to identify travel delay§把出口流量變率直接當居民區水位升速會混淆量綱~Equating outlet discharge ramp with settlement-area level rise confuses dimensions§每天總放流量相同就表示下游影響完全相同~Equal daily release volume guarantees identical downstream effects§(220-100)/30§4
枯水容量與年能量~Drought capacity and annual energy§枯水期間可用水量與水頭可能同時下降，使裝置容量與實際年電量差距擴大。容量因數用年能量除額定功率與時數，僅是事後或情境指標，不直接說明停機原因；需分辨水文限制、設備故障與電網需求。~During drought both available volume and head may fall, widening the gap between capacity and energy. Capacity factor is a retrospective or scenario ratio, not a diagnosis of why output was limited. Separate hydrological constraints, equipment outages and grid demand before interpreting a lower value.§HypotheticalAnnualEnergy=4200 GWh; ratedPower=1000 MW; hours=8760 h; capacityFactor=4200*1000/(1000*8760)=0.479452§將停機紀錄入流與限載原因對照年電量而非只看單一比率~Compare outages, inflow and curtailment causes with annual energy rather than one ratio§容量因數下降可能來自缺水而非機組效率劣化~A lower capacity factor may reflect water shortage rather than degraded unit efficiency§容量因數降低就必定代表水輪機效率降低~A lower capacity factor necessarily means lower turbine efficiency§4200*1000/(1000*8760)§0.4794520547945205
''')
add('b214','以大迪克桑斯重力壩高山集水與壩基監測學習~Studying Grande Dixence gravity action alpine collection and foundation monitoring','公開高度與年代僅作案例背景，合成斷面不等於真實壩形，所有安全比值均非設計評定。~Public height and dates provide context only; synthetic sections are not the actual dam and calculated ratios are not design assessments.','敏感度：合成底面總下向力90000kN與摩擦係數0.7不變，揚力由20000增至30000kN，摩擦抗力由49000降至42000kN，減少14.29%；不能假設排水永久維持初始效果。~Sensitivity: with90000kN downward force and0.7 friction coefficient, raising uplift from20000 to30000kN reduces frictional resistance from49000 to42000kN, or14.29 percent. Drainage cannot be assumed permanently effective at its initial state.',r'''
高山集水與季節庫存~Alpine collection and seasonal storage§大迪克桑斯系統將高山集水與蓄水發電連結，融雪、降雨與輸水設備共同限制可收集水量。流量積分只表示指定時窗的輸入，不代表全部都可用於發電；溢流、抽水耗能及生態放流需在共同水量邊界另列。~Grande Dixence links alpine collection with storage and generation. Snowmelt, rainfall and conveyance capacity constrain captured water. Integrated flow describes one input window, not fully usable generating water; spills, pumping demand and environmental releases belong in the same accounting boundary.§SyntheticCollectedFlow=12 m3/s for20 days; collectedVolume=12*20*86400/1e6=20.736 million m3§將各支流取水與庫存變化對帳並區分抽水輸入與自然入流~Reconcile tributary collection with storage and distinguish pumped from natural inflow§只加總取水量會漏掉輸水損失與非發電放流~Summing collection alone omits conveyance losses and nongenerating releases§收集到的水量必定全部轉成可發電水量~Every collected water volume necessarily becomes generating water§12*20*86400/1e6§20.736
高壩投影水壓~High dam projected hydrostatic load§重力壩以自身重量及地基作用抵抗水平水壓，水深增加使三角分布合力按平方成長。單寬投影式只是二維自由體的一項，壩體實際幾何、尾水與地震水動力需另列；不能以公共壩高直接替代運轉水深。~A gravity dam resists horizontal water action through weight and foundation interaction. The triangular resultant grows with depth squared. A unit-width projection is one term in a two-dimensional free body; actual geometry, tailwater and seismic hydrodynamics remain separate, and public dam height is not operating depth.§SyntheticWaterDepth=180 m; unitWidth=1 m; hydrostaticForce=0.5*9.81*180**2=158922 kN per m width§以同時庫尾水位及實測斷面建立完整荷載圖~Build the complete load diagram from simultaneous reservoir and tailwater levels and surveyed sections§把結構總高度當滿水深會錯置受壓範圍與力矩~Using total structural height as water depth misplaces the loaded area and moment§公開壩高就是任何工況下的實際水深~Published dam height equals actual water depth in every condition§0.5*9.81*180**2§158922
混凝土自重與質量~Concrete weight and mass§壩體混凝土的密度與體積先給質量，再乘重力才得到重量，兩者不可混用。合成單寬斷面自重須使用斷面面積與厚度，廊道和空洞另扣；重心位置同樣重要，因其決定抵抗力矩而不只總重量。~Density and volume yield mass; multiplying by gravity yields weight. A synthetic unit-width section needs area and thickness, with galleries and voids deducted. The centroid matters as much as total weight because it sets the resisting moment rather than merely the downward force.§SyntheticSectionArea=12000 m2; width=1 m; concreteDensity=2400 kg/m3; weight=12000*1*2400*9.81/1000=282528 kN§核對廊道扣除與重心位置並分別列出質量及重量單位~Check gallery deductions and centroid and distinguish mass units from force units§漏扣大廊道或錯置重心會同時影響自重與穩定力矩~Omitted galleries or a misplaced centroid alter weight and stability moments§混凝土質量的噸數可以直接當作千牛頓重量~Concrete mass in tonnes can be used directly as weight in kilonewtons§12000*2400*9.81/1000§282528
底面揚力與排水~Base uplift and drainage§底面孔壓降低有效下向接觸力，防滲帷幕與排水需要分別檢查。線性水頭分布僅為明示假設，排水孔附近及節理連通可使實際分布不線性；不能只測單一孔壓就推定整個底面揚力，還需監測排水能力。~Base pressure reduces effective downward contact. Grout curtains and drains need distinct checks. A linear head profile is an explicit assumption; drains and connected joints can make the real distribution nonlinear. One pressure reading cannot determine total uplift, so monitor pressure distribution and drainage performance together.§Linear base head: upstream=100 m; downstream=20 m; baseWidth=80 m; stripWidth=1 m; uplift=9.81*(100+20)/2*80=47088 kN§沿底面廊道孔壓與排水流量核對假設分布~Compare gallery piezometers and drainage flow with the assumed base-pressure profile§排水堵塞會讓既有線性低壓假設失去依據~Drain blockage invalidates an assumed low-pressure profile§一個排水孔壓力低就代表整個底面揚力低~Low pressure at one drain proves low uplift across the entire base§9.81*60*80§47088
合力偏心與接觸~Resultant eccentricity and contact§單寬底面合力的偏心決定線彈性接觸壓力分布，核心範圍判斷須明示底面不能承拉或可承拉的模型。矩形全接觸公式在算出拉應力時已提示假設可能失效，不能保留負接觸壓力繼續當真實地基反力。~Resultant eccentricity controls the linear base-pressure distribution. State whether tension can be transferred. A full-contact rectangular formula that predicts tension signals a possible breakdown of its own assumption; negative contact pressure should not simply be retained as a real foundation reaction.§SyntheticBaseWidth=60 m; resultantEccentricity=8 m; middleThirdLimit=60/6=10 m; geometricMargin=10-8=2 m§以完整荷載力矩求合力位置並核對接觸模型是否允許拉力~Locate the resultant from all moments and check whether the contact model permits tension§超出全接觸適用範圍仍用線性式會錯估壓縮區~Using full-contact equations beyond their range misstates the compressed area§合力在底面內就保證全底面始終受壓~A resultant anywhere inside the base guarantees compression over the entire base§60/6-8§2
抗滑摩擦與揚壓~Sliding friction and uplift§摩擦抗力取決於有效正力而非總自重，揚壓、地震與不同荷載組合會改變可用接觸。無黏聚簡式只估一項抗力，不能代表含節理岩體的完整穩定；接觸面粗糙、剪脹及強度退化需由適當試驗與分析建立。~Friction depends on effective normal force rather than gross weight. Uplift and load combinations alter contact. A cohesionless expression estimates one resistance component, not complete stability in jointed rock; roughness, dilation and degradation require suitable testing and analysis before using a strength parameter.§totalDownwardForce=90000 kN; uplift=20000 kN; frictionCoefficient=0.7; frictionResistance=(90000-20000)*0.7=49000 kN§核對揚壓量測與接觸剪力試驗並分列各荷載組合~Check measured uplift and interface shear testing and list load combinations separately§用總自重計摩擦會高估有揚壓時的抗滑能力~Using gross weight for friction overstates resistance when uplift acts§揚壓只影響抗浮而不影響滑動摩擦~Uplift affects flotation only and never sliding friction§(90000-20000)*0.7§49000
水化熱與拘束~Hydration heat and restraint§大量混凝土的內外溫差與基礎拘束可形成熱應力，澆置分塊及降溫歷程影響開裂。單軸完全拘束且橫向可自由變形的線彈性公式只是應力量級，實際徐變、成熟度與裂縫會鬆弛應力；應用溫度與應變同步紀錄判斷，而非只量表面溫度。~Mass concrete develops thermal stress through gradients and restraint. Block placement and cooling history affect cracking. An elastic estimate with full axial restraint and free lateral deformation gives a uniaxial stress scale only; creep, maturity and cracking relax stress. Interpret temperature and strain together rather than using surface temperature as the full thermal state.§Uniaxial full axial restraint with free lateral deformation: E=25 GPa; alpha=10e-6 perK; cooling=12 K; elasticStress=25e9*10e-6*12/1e6=3 MPa§比較核心表面溫度與埋設應變並記錄混凝土齡期~Compare core and surface temperatures with embedded strain and concrete age§忽略徐變或拘束差異會使彈性熱應力被誤當實測值~Ignoring creep or restraint differences turns an elastic estimate into a false measured stress§完全拘束彈性熱應力就是所有實際位置的應力~Fully restrained elastic thermal stress equals stress at every actual location§25e9*10e-6*12/1e6§3
帷幕試驗與滲透~Curtain testing and permeability§灌漿帷幕應改變裂隙導水而非只追求灌入量，取芯、壓水與監測資料共同評估效果。前後流量比只能在同壓差及試段條件下比較，不能直接等同整壩滲透率降幅；地下水路重分配需靠廊道孔壓與流量追蹤。~A grout curtain should alter fracture conductance, not merely absorb grout volume. Compare pressure tests, cores and monitoring. A before-and-after flow ratio requires matching test intervals and pressure; it does not directly equal whole-dam permeability reduction because pathways may redistribute through the foundation.§Matched test pressure: initialWaterTake=20 L/min; finalWaterTake=5 L/min; observedReduction=(20-5)/20*100=75 percent§保持試段長度壓差一致並比較帷幕上下游孔壓~Match interval length and pressure and compare heads on both sides of the curtain§只看灌漿量多會誤把遠處流失當有效封堵~Large grout take can represent loss elsewhere instead of effective sealing§灌漿量越多就必定代表防滲效果越好~More injected grout necessarily means better seepage control§(20-5)/20*100§75
垂線位移與溫度~Plumb-line movement and temperature§壩內垂線與外部測量可追蹤壩體位移，但基準點穩定與溫度水位效應需分開。差值代表相對運動而非絕對地盤移動，參考端本身若漂移需額外控制；應用長期可逆模式辨認新的不可逆殘差。~Internal plumb lines and external surveys track movement, but reference stability and temperature-stage effects need separation. A difference is relative motion, not absolute ground movement. If the reference moves, independent control is needed; use reversible long-term patterns to identify a new irreversible residual.§MeasuredRelativeDisplacement=18 mm; temperatureStageBaseline=13 mm; residual=18-13=5 mm§以外部控制網與倒垂線比較基準穩定並核對季節循環~Compare reference stability using external control and inverted plumb lines and check seasonal cycles§基準端移動可使壩體看似發生相反方向位移~Reference movement can make the dam appear to move in the opposite direction§垂線差值必定就是壩體絕對地理位移~A plumb-line difference necessarily equals absolute geographic dam movement§18-13§5
高落差輸水與淨能量~High-head conveyance and net energy§高山蓄水到低處電廠的高程差提供勢能，輸水損失與抽水投入則影響淨能量。以指定流量與淨水頭估出力只代表單一工作點，不能把壩高等同全系統落差；水路壓力、暫態與機組效率需另作聯合驗證。~Elevation difference from alpine storage to lower generating plants supplies potential energy, while losses and pumping inputs affect net benefit. Power at specified flow and net head is one operating point. Dam height is not total scheme head; waterway pressures, transients and efficiency require joint verification.§HypotheticalQ=25 m3/s; netHead=900 m; efficiency=0.92; power=1000*9.81*25*900*0.92/1e6=203.067 MW§同步核對上下游能量線機組功率及抽水投入~Check energy lines, generating power and pumping input over matching periods§把發電毛能量當淨收益會漏掉抽水與輸水損失~Treating gross generation as net benefit omits pumping input and conveyance losses§壩高就是整個高山水電系統的總發電落差~Dam height equals the full generating head of an alpine scheme§1000*9.81*25*900*0.92/1e6§203.067
''')
